// ID: GCI-KQL-VIRT-001
// Title: VMware vCenter management-plane activity keywords
// Platform: Microsoft Sentinel
// Type: Triage hunt (keyword-based; not an exploit signature)
// Data source: Syslog (VMware vCenter forwarded syslog)
// Required fields: TimeGenerated, HostName, HostIP, ProcessName, SyslogMessage
// Maturity: Draft — validate log format and keywords against deployed vCenter version
// Source: reports/2026/11/22.md
// ATT&CK: No direct mapping; use as an investigation pivot only.
// False positives: Normal SSO, directory service, administrative login and configuration activity.
// Tuning: Establish normal admin patterns; correlate with change records, source IP, account and ESXi operations.

Syslog
| where TimeGenerated >= ago(24h)
| where SyslogMessage has_any (
    "administrator@vsphere.local",
    "SAML", "vmdir", "data.mdb",
    "CreateUser", "AddUser", "Login"
)
| project TimeGenerated, HostName, HostIP, ProcessName, SyslogMessage
| order by TimeGenerated desc
